  "limitations": [
    "These are small source rechecks near existing published city samples, not city completeness, countrywide completeness, boundary legality, positional accuracy, freshness, license or reuse determinations.",
    "A failed property-selection query or server-side count inconsistency is recorded as such, not as evidence that parcels are absent.",
    "The source files contain only IDs and geometry for retained samples; response hashes do not preserve raw response bodies.",
